sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Device
    participant G as Gateway
    participant C as Cloud
    D->>G: reading (plaintext)

    Note over G: #nbsp;encapsulate(public key)#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;→ shared secret + KEM ciphertext#nbsp;
    Note over G: #nbsp;AES-256-GCM encrypt#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;reading + timestamp#nbsp;
    G->>C: kem_ciphertext, nonce, ciphertext
    Note over C: #nbsp;decapsulate(private key)#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;→ same shared secret#nbsp;
    Note over C: #nbsp;decrypt, check timestamp,#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;validate, store in SQLite#nbsp;
    C-->>G: 200 stored
    G-->>D: 200 forwarded
